ine/godot/pull/105821#issuecomment-2833437046","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105821","id":2833437046,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6o4tF2","user":{"login":"Grublady","id":29121925,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTIxOTI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29121925?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady","html_url":"https://github.com/Grublady","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-27T12:33:49Z","updated_at":"2025-04-27T12:33:49Z","body":"The only thing I could come up with that really maintains locality would be to override `get_property_list` for `MultiNodeEdit`.\r\n\r\nI had dropped it because that would require making the method `virtual` for all `Object`s, which seemed like overkill, but perhaps that approach is closer to what we want—\r\n\r\nI can put together a separate PR and link to it so that strategy can be discussed.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2833437046/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2833438589","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105821#issuecomment-2833438589","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105821","id":2833438589,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6o4td9","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-27T12:37:29Z","updated_at":"2025-04-27T12:40:59Z","body":"No need to override, it already has an override:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e37c6261ea48b1a339c469282df7e9b7c073a72f/editor/multi_node_edit.cpp#L123-L176\r\n\r\nThat's the proper place IMO, shouldn't be a problem ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2833438589/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2833440348","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105821#issuecomment-2833440348","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105821","id":2833440348,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6o4t5c","user":{"login":"Grublady","id":29121925,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTIxOTI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29121925?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady","html_url":"https://github.com/Grublady","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-27T12:41:49Z","updated_at":"2025-04-27T12:46:03Z","body":"`_get_property_list` (with a leading underscore) has an override, but `get_property_list` (without a leading underscore) does not.\r\n\r\nThe issue is that `get_property_list` calls `_get_property_listv`, which then recursively calls `_get_property_list` on both the object and its parent types (ie `RefCounted`):\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e37c6261ea48b1a339c469282df7e9b7c073a72f/core/object/object.cpp#L563\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e37c6261ea48b1a339c469282df7e9b7c073a72f/core/object/object.h#L494-L506\r\n\r\nSo there is currently no way to avoid the addition of `RefCounted`'s properties when calling `get_property_list` on a type that inherits it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2833440348/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0